              "description": "Path to test data CSV file.\nComplete file path to the CSV file containing test data with the same structure as training data. Used for independent model evaluation and performance assessment. Should have identical column structure to training data.\n\"data/test.csv\", \"datasets/materials_test.csv\", \"ml_data/test_features.csv\"",
